        "description": "A slime life form accidentally created by Kotarou Kawaii in his childhood. She considers herself the cutest slime, and her dream is to become a synonym for “kawaii\". Recently, Kotarou has stopped calling her cute, so she is pursuing various “kawaii” forms on a daily basis in order to be recognized as such...!",
